### Listar Produtos
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/produtos

### Registro de Usuário
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Teste",
  "email": "joao@teste.com",
  "telefone": "11999999999",
  "senha": "senha123",
  "confirmacaoSenha": "senha123"
}

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@teste.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
